# Vercel upload exclusions for apps/web (deploy runs from the repo root).
#
# Vercel runs `pnpm install` and `next build` itself, so build output and
# dependencies must not be uploaded: they are regenerated on Vercel and would
# otherwise be both wasted upload and a source of stale-artifact bugs. Without
# this the upload exceeded Vercel's 15000-file limit.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.vercel
**/.vercel
*.log
**/*.log
.git
**/.git

# Generated fonts manifest is committed but the woff2 faces are what matter.
apps/extension/dist
